      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Right after San Antonio\u2019s Battle of Flowers, Pearl\u2019s Viva Pearl Fiesta offers live music, DJ sets, salsa lessons, and local vendor stalls for families.",
